IGEL_THUNDERBOLT_PCIE_DELAYED_RESCAN
	  Spurious hotplug events after Thunderbolt tunnel activation can cause
	  pciehp to miss PCIe devices behind the tunnel ~70% of the time.
	  A delayed pci_rescan_bus() is scheduled 300 ms after tunnel activation
	  to reliably enumerate devices without disrupting normally working systems.

	  Source: Ubuntu
	  Commit: 8aecf0856dfad63b913755ae58f21358100827d8
diff --git a/drivers/thunderbolt/tb.c b/drivers/thunderbolt/tb.c
